\lx fwįtuuya xɛntįįye
\va fwįtuuya xεntįįye
\va fwįtuuya xԑntįįye
\ps n
\gf les pronoms possessifs
\ge the possessive pronouns
\ph fʷįtuːja xɛntįːje
\gvf les pronoms possessifs
\gve the possessive pronouns
\sm Pronoms qui indiquent la possession.
